{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 1350,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hi, I’m Oli."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2700,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Welcome to Oxford Online English!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4830,
    "dDurationMs": 3359,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In this lesson, you can learn how to talk\nabout food."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 8189,
    "dDurationMs": 5561,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You’ll see how to talk about different cuisines,\ntalk about food you like – or dislike – and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 13750,
    "dDurationMs": 2470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "talk about cooking and eating habits."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 16220,
    "dDurationMs": 5760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To see more free English lessons, visit our\nwebsite: Oxford Online English dot com."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 21980,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can also book English classes with our\nfully-qualified teachers, who can help you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 26580,
    "dDurationMs": 5470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with your English speaking, writing, IELTS\npreparation, or whatever else you need."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 32050,
    "dDurationMs": 4820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Don’t forget to turn on the subtitles for\nthis video if you need them!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 36870,
    "dDurationMs": 2369,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All our videos have English subtitles."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 39239,
    "dDurationMs": 6010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can turn them on now: just click the ‘CC’\nbutton in the bottom right of the video player."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 45249,
    "dDurationMs": 7601,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On a smartphone, tap the settings icon to\nturn on subtitles."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 52850,
    "dDurationMs": 1430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What kind of food do you like?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 54280,
    "dDurationMs": 1599,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I like a bit of everything, really."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 55879,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I grew up in the UK, and you can get food\nfrom all over the world there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 59659,
    "dDurationMs": 4281,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My mum’s cooking is a combination of different\ncuisines: a bit of French, a bit of Italian,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 63940,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a bit of Indian, and so on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 66250,
    "dDurationMs": 1490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What’s British cuisine like?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 67740,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I know about fish and chips, but there must\nbe more…"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 70640,
    "dDurationMs": 2060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There is, but not that much."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 72700,
    "dDurationMs": 4459,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are a few famous dishes like shepherd’s\npie or Sunday roast, but most people eat a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 77159,
    "dDurationMs": 1541,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "mix of things."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 78700,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What about you?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 79700,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What food do you like?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 81220,
    "dDurationMs": 4770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I’m half Spanish, so when I was young we\nate a lot of Mediterranean food at home."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 85990,
    "dDurationMs": 4979,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, I live in Berlin, and it’s a pretty\ncosmopolitan place, so you can get all kinds"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 90969,
    "dDurationMs": 1940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of food, like the UK, I suppose."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 92909,
    "dDurationMs": 2791,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I’ve never really had much Spanish food."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 95700,
    "dDurationMs": 1640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is it similar to Italian?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 97340,
    "dDurationMs": 1839,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In some ways, yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 99179,
    "dDurationMs": 4111,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They both use a lot of fresh ingredients,\nand there’s a lot of seafood, salads, and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 103290,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 104290,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Pasta isn’t so common in Spanish cooking,\nthough."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 107140,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What are some typical Spanish dishes?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 109500,
    "dDurationMs": 1640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I’d be interested to try some."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 111140,
    "dDurationMs": 2439,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I guess paella is quite well-known."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 113579,
    "dDurationMs": 5150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My personal favourite is a dish called albondigas,\nwhich is meatballs in a tomato sauce."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 118729,
    "dDurationMs": 2140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It’s simple, but so tasty."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 120869,
    "dDurationMs": 1331,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sounds good!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 122200,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here’s a question: do you know the difference\nbetween the words ‘cuisine’, ‘dish’"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 127200,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and ‘meal’?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 129430,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "‘Cuisine’ means the kind of food you find\nin a specific country or culture."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 134530,
    "dDurationMs": 7140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For example, you have Chinese cuisine, French\ncuisine, local cuisine, and so on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 141670,
    "dDurationMs": 3690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "‘Cuisine’ means something like ‘cooking\nstyle’."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 145360,
    "dDurationMs": 3750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can use the word ‘food’ or ‘cooking’\nin the same way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 149110,
    "dDurationMs": 5480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, you can say ‘Chinese cuisine’, ‘Chinese\ncooking’ or ‘Chinese food’."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 154590,
    "dDurationMs": 1790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The meaning is very close."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 156380,
    "dDurationMs": 3980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A ‘dish’ means something which is cooked\nor prepared."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 160360,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Usually, a dish is made from different kinds\nof food."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 163900,
    "dDurationMs": 4190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A ‘meal’ is food eaten at a specific time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 168090,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Most people eat three meals a day: breakfast,\nlunch and dinner."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 172650,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We often hear English learners make mistakes\nwith these three words, so be careful with"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 177330,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "them!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 178590,
    "dDurationMs": 5670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In the dialogue, you heard how to talk about\ndifferent cuisines and dishes which you like."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 184260,
    "dDurationMs": 3510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Look at some questions you heard."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 187770,
    "dDurationMs": 3190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Think about how you could answer these."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 190960,
    "dDurationMs": 3790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you answer these questions, try to be\ndetailed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 194750,
    "dDurationMs": 4090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For example, don’t just say ‘Vietnamese\nfood is delicious.’"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 198840,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Give some more details!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 200940,
    "dDurationMs": 5190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Say what kind of dishes are the best, or try\nto explain why you like it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 206130,
    "dDurationMs": 5740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For example, you could say ‘Vietnamese food\nis delicious, because it uses fresh ingredients"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 211870,
    "dDurationMs": 4630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it’s a little bit spicy, which I like.’"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 216500,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "OK?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 217700,
    "dDurationMs": 5480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Pause the video and try to answer the questions\nnow."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 223190,
    "dDurationMs": 1170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Could you do it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 224360,
    "dDurationMs": 3290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If not, go back and listen to the dialogue\nagain."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 227650,
    "dDurationMs": 8190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Next, let’s look at how to talk about food\nyou like – or don’t!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 235840,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, what do you think?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 237680,
    "dDurationMs": 980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh no!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 238670,
    "dDurationMs": 1050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is terrible!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 239720,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Really?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 240720,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "First, you haven’t cooked the meat long\nenough."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 243420,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It’s tough and really chewy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 245900,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You need to keep cooking it until it’s tender."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 247850,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I cooked it for two hours, just like you said!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 251010,
    "dDurationMs": 3490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, but you also have to check that it’s\ndone!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 254500,
    "dDurationMs": 2270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Also, these vegetables are awful."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 256770,
    "dDurationMs": 2980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They’re mushy because you’ve overcooked\nthem."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 259750,
    "dDurationMs": 1870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They should be fresh and crunchy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 261620,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right…"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 263500,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What about the sauce?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 264500,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It’s not bad, but it’s a little bland."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 267290,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A dish like this should be rich, spicy and\na little sour."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 270730,
    "dDurationMs": 4690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "While you’re cooking, don’t forget to\ntaste it, and add more spices, or more vinegar,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 275420,
    "dDurationMs": 1090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or whatever it needs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 276510,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hmm…"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 277510,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "OK…"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 278510,
    "dDurationMs": 2530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I’m a little scared to show you my dessert,\nnow."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 281040,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ahh, wow!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 282660,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is amazing!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 283920,
    "dDurationMs": 980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 284900,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You mean it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 286290,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 287290,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It’s a perfect tart."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 288290,
    "dDurationMs": 4170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It’s crumbly, but not dry, which is a difficult\nbalance to get right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 292460,
    "dDurationMs": 2570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The fruit gives it a nice, tangy flavour."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 295030,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Very tasty!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 296030,
    "dDurationMs": 1340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thank you!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 297370,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To describe something you ate, you could start\nwith the flavour."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 301650,
    "dDurationMs": 5980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For example, you can use words like ‘spicy’,\n‘sour’, ‘sweet’, ‘bitter’, or"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 307630,
    "dDurationMs": 1120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "‘rich’."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 308750,
    "dDurationMs": 4090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "‘Rich’ can be used to describe heavier\nfoods."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 312840,
    "dDurationMs": 2650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You also heard ‘bland’ in the dialogue."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 315490,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "‘Bland’ describes something which has\nlittle or no flavour."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 319590,
    "dDurationMs": 3530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then, you could also describe the texture."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 323120,
    "dDurationMs": 3460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In the dialogue, you heard the word ‘mushy’."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 326580,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do you know what this means?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 329520,
    "dDurationMs": 4660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "‘Mushy’ means that something is soft,\nbut in an unpleasant way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 334180,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you cook vegetables too long, they’ll\nget mushy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 337940,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In the dialogue, you also heard ‘tough’,\n‘chewy’, ‘tender’, ‘crunchy’ and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 342660,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "‘crumbly’."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 343740,
    "dDurationMs": 4740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Can you think of foods which these words could\ndescribe?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 348480,
    "dDurationMs": 2440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "‘Tough’ and ‘chewy’ are similar."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 350920,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Both describe foods which are difficult to\neat because you have to chew them for a long"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 355200,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 356200,
    "dDurationMs": 5620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Meat can be tough or chewy, especially if\nit’s cooked too long and it gets dry."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 361820,
    "dDurationMs": 5910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "‘Tender’ means something like ‘soft’,\nbut it’s mostly used to describe meat which"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 367730,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is cooked well, so it’s soft and juicy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 371530,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Crunchy foods make a lot of noise when you’re\neating them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 374800,
    "dDurationMs": 4740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dry food – like potato chips, or hard cookies\n– can be crunchy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 379540,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Crumbly food is soft and easily breaks into\npieces."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 384100,
    "dDurationMs": 5950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "‘Crumbly’ can be good or bad – for a\ncake, it might be a good thing, but crumbly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 390050,
    "dDurationMs": 4630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "bread might be a bad thing, because it will\nfall apart when you try to do anything with"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 394680,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 395680,
    "dDurationMs": 5720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you like the taste of something, you can\nuse general adjectives like ‘great’, ‘amazing’"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 401400,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or ‘fantastic’."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 402780,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can also use ‘tasty’ or ‘delicious’."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 405700,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Be careful: ‘delicious’ is a strong adjective."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 409400,
    "dDurationMs": 5650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That means you can’t say ‘very delicious’;\nif you want to add emphasis, say ‘really"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 415050,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "delicious’ or ‘absolutely delicious’."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 418090,
    "dDurationMs": 5420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To talk about food you don’t like, use general\nadjectives like ‘awful’, ‘terrible’"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 423510,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or ‘disgusting’."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 425430,
    "dDurationMs": 7209,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, a challenge for you: think about the\nlast thing you ate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 432639,
    "dDurationMs": 1761,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Could you describe it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 434400,
    "dDurationMs": 5040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Talk about the flavour, the texture, and whether\nyou liked it or not."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 439440,
    "dDurationMs": 4449,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For a bonus, try to explain why you did or\ndidn’t like it!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 443889,
    "dDurationMs": 4511,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For example: ‘The last thing I ate was a\nlentil soup."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 448400,
    "dDurationMs": 4660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was quite spicy, but a little bit mushy,\nbecause I overcooked the lentils."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 453060,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I didn’t like it so much, because it was\na little bland."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 457180,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Lentils don’t have much flavour.’"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 461020,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now it’s your turn."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 462520,
    "dDurationMs": 4620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Pause the video and make your answer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 467140,
    "dDurationMs": 7100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Next, let’s see how you can talk about cooking\nhabits."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 474240,
    "dDurationMs": 1070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do you cook much?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 475310,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sometimes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 476310,
    "dDurationMs": 3930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I cook maybe twice a week, but I’m too busy\nto do more than that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 480240,
    "dDurationMs": 1330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What do you do the rest of the time?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 481570,
    "dDurationMs": 3110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For lunch, I eat in the canteen at work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 484680,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In the evening, I generally get something\nfrom the supermarket, or get a takeaway."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 488560,
    "dDurationMs": 4230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don’t like it, because I know it’s more\nexpensive and less healthy than cooking for"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 492790,
    "dDurationMs": 3350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "myself, but I just don’t have the time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 496140,
    "dDurationMs": 1240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What about you?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 497380,
    "dDurationMs": 1819,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I make most of my meals."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 499199,
    "dDurationMs": 2031,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don’t cook every day, though."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 501230,
    "dDurationMs": 4820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I normally do a lot of cooking on Sunday,\nand then I have food for the week."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 506050,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I take a packed lunch to work, and then eat\nleftovers in the evening."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 509550,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That’s a good system!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 511070,
    "dDurationMs": 1690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I wish I could be so organised…"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 512760,
    "dDurationMs": 2939,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It helps that I have a market very close to\nmy house."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 515699,
    "dDurationMs": 5510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They have great fresh produce, fish, meat…\neverything you need."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 521209,
    "dDurationMs": 2721,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That means I don’t need to spend much time\nshopping."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 523930,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Plus, I prefer eating home-cooked, fresh food."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 527430,
    "dDurationMs": 5650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If I don’t have food with me, I end up eating\ngreasy fast food, and then I feel bloated"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 533080,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and gross."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 534080,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, I’m the same way…"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 536380,
    "dDurationMs": 2350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Maybe I’ll start cooking more."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 538730,
    "dDurationMs": 4669,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Think about the first question you heard in\nthe dialogue: ‘Do you cook much?’"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 543399,
    "dDurationMs": 3401,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How would you answer this?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 546800,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You could say something like: ‘I cook every\nday.’"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 551320,
    "dDurationMs": 4820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "‘I don’t cook much – maybe once or twice\na week.’"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 556140,
    "dDurationMs": 1020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "‘I don’t cook."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 557160,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I’ve never learned how!’"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 560430,
    "dDurationMs": 3019,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you don’t cook, what can you do for food?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 563449,
    "dDurationMs": 3010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You heard some phrases in the dialogue."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 566459,
    "dDurationMs": 2930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do you remember?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 569389,
    "dDurationMs": 4291,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Look at some sentences that you heard."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 573680,
    "dDurationMs": 5180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Imagine you’re an English teacher, and you\nwant to explain the meanings of the words"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 578860,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in red."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 580720,
    "dDurationMs": 3239,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How would you do it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 583959,
    "dDurationMs": 5630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A canteen is a bit like a restaurant, but\nit’s run by a company for its staff, or"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 589589,
    "dDurationMs": 2860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by a university for its students."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 592449,
    "dDurationMs": 5750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Canteens are usually cheap, or the food might\neven be free."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 598199,
    "dDurationMs": 5101,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A takeaway means you buy or order the food\nfrom a restaurant, and then eat it somewhere"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 603300,
    "dDurationMs": 3899,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "else, usually at home."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 607199,
    "dDurationMs": 7610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A packed lunch means you take food from home\nand eat it at work or school."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 614809,
    "dDurationMs": 4330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you cook more than you can eat, the extra\nfood is called ‘leftovers’."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 619140,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can eat the leftovers on another day."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 623040,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What about you?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 624540,
    "dDurationMs": 1479,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do you cook much?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 626019,
    "dDurationMs": 2601,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If not, what do you do for food?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 628620,
    "dDurationMs": 4629,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Pause the video now, and try to make a few\nsentences to describe your cooking and eating"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 633249,
    "dDurationMs": 2271,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "habits."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 635520,
    "dDurationMs": 680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Done?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 636200,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Great!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 637340,
    "dDurationMs": 4760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let’s look at our last point."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 642100,
    "dDurationMs": 1969,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, what do we do first?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 644069,
    "dDurationMs": 3010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "First, we need to fry the aubergine and the\npotato."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 647079,
    "dDurationMs": 2810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "While you do that, I’ll prepare the meat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 649889,
    "dDurationMs": 1390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How are you going to do it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 651279,
    "dDurationMs": 5071,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It’s easy: you sauté onion and garlic,\nthen add the meat to brown it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 656350,
    "dDurationMs": 5679,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then you add the tomatoes and simmer it for\nfifteen minutes or so until the sauce thickens."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 662029,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "OK, what now?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 663709,
    "dDurationMs": 2591,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now we need to make the white sauce."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 666300,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know how to make white sauce?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 667680,
    "dDurationMs": 2719,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think so, though I’ve never tried it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 670399,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It’s butter, flour and milk, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 672639,
    "dDurationMs": 2450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, but you need to be careful."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 675089,
    "dDurationMs": 3771,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Add the milk very slowly, and stir the sauce\ncontinuously."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 678860,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Otherwise, it can get lumpy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 680480,
    "dDurationMs": 1859,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Should I use a low heat?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 682340,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, as low as possible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 685440,
    "dDurationMs": 1700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, is that it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 687149,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Pretty much!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 688149,
    "dDurationMs": 4481,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We just need to layer all the parts, sprinkle\nsome grated cheese on top, and then bake it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 692630,
    "dDurationMs": 1269,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for half an hour."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 693899,
    "dDurationMs": 1490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What should I do, then?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 695389,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Get a baking dish."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 696389,
    "dDurationMs": 4450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Put the potatoes in the bottom, then the aubergine,\nthen the meat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 700839,
    "dDurationMs": 5060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Add another layer of aubergine on top, then\npour in the white sauce."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 705899,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is it ready?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 706899,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, I think so."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 707899,
    "dDurationMs": 2030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It should be lightly brown on top."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 709929,
    "dDurationMs": 3031,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nice work – you made your first moussaka!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 712960,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By the way, do you know what ‘moussaka’\nis?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 715920,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It’s a famous Greek dish."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 717720,
    "dDurationMs": 4229,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It’s easy to find recipes online if you\nwant to try making it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 721949,
    "dDurationMs": 4730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In the dialogue, you heard several different\nverbs related to food preparation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 726679,
    "dDurationMs": 3041,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do you remember any?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 729720,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Look at some pairs of words."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 733880,
    "dDurationMs": 3709,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Could you explain the difference in meaning\nbetween these words pairs?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 737589,
    "dDurationMs": 4411,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Pause the video to think about it if you need\ntime."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 742000,
    "dDurationMs": 6050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "‘Sauté’ and ‘fry’ both mean to cook\nsomething in hot fat – usually hot oil."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 748050,
    "dDurationMs": 5060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "‘Sauté’ means that you cook something\nat high temperature for a short time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 753110,
    "dDurationMs": 5060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In everyday language, people mostly say ‘fry’,\nbut if you’re reading a recipe or watching"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 758170,
    "dDurationMs": 5310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "cooking shows on TV, you might see ‘sauté’."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 763480,
    "dDurationMs": 5899,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "‘Boil’ and ‘simmer’ both mean to heat\na liquid until it bubbles; ‘simmer’ suggests"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 769380,
    "dDurationMs": 2860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you keep the heat as low as possible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 772240,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "‘Boil’ means you use a higher heat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 776260,
    "dDurationMs": 2269,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "‘Pour’ is only for liquids."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 778529,
    "dDurationMs": 4591,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "‘Sprinkle’ means to spread a small amount\nof something over something else."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 783120,
    "dDurationMs": 5819,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "‘Sprinkle’ is mostly used for powders\nor things made of small particles, like salt,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 788940,
    "dDurationMs": 3980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "herbs, grated cheese, and so on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 792920,
    "dDurationMs": 1819,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, it’s your turn."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 794739,
    "dDurationMs": 2051,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Think about a dish you know how to make."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 796790,
    "dDurationMs": 4539,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Your job is to give detailed instructions\nfor how to make it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 801329,
    "dDurationMs": 6190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Imagine you’re teaching someone, and you\nwant to describe every step of the process."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 807519,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Before you do this, you can watch the dialogue\nagain."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 810999,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are many more words and phrases you\ncan use to help you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 814839,
    "dDurationMs": 3021,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Pause the video, and say your answer out loud."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 817860,
    "dDurationMs": 4979,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Or, you can write your answer down and share\nyour recipe with other students in the comments!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 822839,
    "dDurationMs": 1141,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That’s all."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 823980,
    "dDurationMs": 1250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thanks for watching!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 825230,
    "dDurationMs": 690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "See you next time!"
    } ]
  } ]
}
